WHAT THIS LICENSE COVERS

Only the material authored for this repository:

  scripts/    the analysis and plotting code
  repro/      the entrypoints
  data/       the shipped plot-ready analysis outputs
  figures/    the rendered figures
  envs/       the conda environment specifications
  README.md and the SOURCE.md provenance notes


WHAT IT DOES NOT COVER

The three generative models this work probes are third-party software, and each
carries its own license and its own terms of use. Nothing here grants any right
to them:

  MolMiner    https://github.com/raulorteg/molminer
  HierVAE     https://github.com/wengong-jin/hgraph2graph
  GDSS        https://github.com/harryjo97/GDSS

Consult each upstream repository for its license before use or redistribution.

The patch files under models/ are diffs against those upstream sources. They are
provided only to reproduce the environment described in models/SETUP.md, and the
upstream project's license governs the patched result.

Model checkpoints are distributed separately (see the Zenodo records linked in
README.md) under the terms stated in those records.

The training data (ZINC) and any third-party dependency, RDKit included, remain
subject to their own licenses.
